#: sections/faq.twig:10
msgid "What are credits?"
msgstr "Kreditlar nima?"

#: sections/faq.twig:11
msgid "Credits are what you spend when you use the AI. Each request costs credits based on the model and how much it produces, and your plan includes a set amount."
msgstr "AI’dan foydalanganingizda kredit sarflaysiz. Har bir so‘rov uchun sarflanadigan kreditlar soni modelga va u qancha natija yaratishiga bog‘liq, rejangizda esa ma’lum miqdorda kredit mavjud."

#: sections/faq.twig:11
msgid "Need more? Top up with a credit pack at any time."
msgstr "Ko‘proq kerakmi? Istalgan vaqtda kreditlar to‘plamini xarid qilib, hisobingizni to‘ldiring."

#: sections/faq.twig:15
msgid "How is usage measured?"
msgstr "Foydalanish miqdori qanday hisoblanadi?"

#: sections/faq.twig:16
msgid "Each plan includes an amount of usage. What a request uses depends on the model and how much it produces, and your account always shows what you have left."
msgstr "Har bir rejada ma’lum miqdorda foydalanish limiti bor. So‘rov qancha resurs sarflashi modelga va u qancha natija yaratishiga bog‘liq, hisobingizda esa qolgan miqdor doim ko‘rsatiladi."

#: sections/faq.twig:20
msgid "Which AI models can I use?"
msgstr "Qaysi AI modellaridan foydalanishim mumkin?"

#: sections/faq.twig:21
msgid "Each plan lists the models it includes. Hover over the models line on a plan to see them, and pick the one you want while you work."
msgstr "Har bir rejada unga kiruvchi modellar ro‘yxati keltirilgan. Ularni ko‘rish uchun reja ustidagi modellar qatori ustiga kursorni olib boring, ishlayotganingizda esa kerakli modelni tanlang."

#: sections/faq.twig:25
msgid "Can I change or cancel my plan?"
msgstr "Rejamni o‘zgartira yoki bekor qila olamanmi?"

#: sections/faq.twig:26
msgid "Yes. You can upgrade, downgrade or cancel from the billing page in your account at any time."
msgstr "Ha. Hisobingizdagi to‘lov sahifasidan istalgan vaqtda yuqoriroq yoki pastroq rejaga o‘tishingiz yoki obunani bekor qilishingiz mumkin."

#: sections/faq.twig:30
msgid "Is there a free trial?"
msgstr "Bepul sinov muddati bormi?"

#: sections/faq.twig:31
msgid "Yes. Paid subscriptions start with a :days-day free trial. Cancel before it ends and you will not be charged."
msgstr "Ha. Pullik obunalar :days-day davom etadigan bepul sinov muddatidan boshlanadi. Muddat tugashidan oldin bekor qilsangiz, sizdan haq olinmaydi."

#: sections/faq.twig:35
msgid "Can I use it with my team?"
msgstr "Undan jamoam bilan foydalana olamanmi?"

#: sections/faq.twig:36
msgid "Yes. Invite teammates to your workspace and they share its plan. How many members you can add depends on your plan."
msgstr "Ha. Jamoa a’zolarini ish maydoningizga taklif qiling, ular sizning tarif rejangizdan foydalanadi. Qo‘shishingiz mumkin bo‘lgan a’zolar soni tarif rejangizga bog‘liq."

#: sections/faq.twig:40
msgid "What happens to what I create?"
msgstr "Men yaratgan narsalar nima bo‘ladi?"

#: sections/faq.twig:41
msgid "It is saved to your library so you can find it later. Switch on private mode and nothing you create is kept: it stays out of your history and is deleted automatically."
msgstr "Ular kutubxonangizda saqlanadi, shunda keyinroq topa olasiz. Maxfiy rejimni yoqing — yaratgan hech narsangiz saqlanmaydi: u tarixingizda ko‘rinmaydi va avtomatik ravishda o‘chirib tashlanadi."

#: sections/faq.twig:49
msgctxt "heading"
msgid "Frequently asked questions"
msgstr "Ko‘p beriladigan savollar"

#: sections/faq.twig:52
msgid "Answers to what people ask most before they sign up."
msgstr "Ro‘yxatdan o‘tishdan oldin ko‘pchilik beradigan savollarga javoblar."

